title: Bump litep2p to 0.15.3
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: This fixes some internal issues of litep2p assuming connections still
    being alive while this not being the case anymore.
crates:
- name: libpsc-network-types2p
  bump: patch
- name: sc-network
  bump: patch
- name: sc-network-bitswap
  bump: patch
